    "title": "Wichita Fire Chief Tammy Snow to Retire in August 2026 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago After nearly 40 years of serving Wichita in various roles with the Wichita Fire Department, Elizabeth C. “Tammy” Snow announces her retirement, effective August 2026. She was appointed as the department chief in 2017, becoming the first female fire chief since the founding of the Wichita Fire Department in 1886. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
